  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ab97b6e1f9f33c74dbe28807a4d3a797, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogText: {fileID: 2144049306}
  DialogRaw:
  - No...
  - No...
  - How could this happen, all these years.. turned into nothing
  - I even manipulated the magic keeping us here to bring back the guards, yet nothing
    could stop you
  - As a ghost we live now and we are bound by a contract that not even I could break
  - I lost and so you must have my token, as much as I hate it
  - Go back now to the locked Throne room and unlock it
  - You have won...
