  dialogText: {fileID: 1238372118}
  DialogRaw:
  - You have fought well, So you deserve this
  - Hm? Yes Urist has told you the truth, if you have three tokens you can claim
    the crown from the main hall
  - 'Me, Urist and Aremonar were the last three rulers of '
  - As such it is duty to remain here after death to find someone to pass the kingdom
    onto
  - But if I may be honest, I am worried that something is not right. It has been
    too long and too few challengers have appeared
  - Find Aremonar, He is the only one of us who is powerful enough to understand
    the magic behind this
