  m_Text: '1- If you''re having a hard time reaching a place, try going somewhere
    else- You might find something to help you


    2- Only up to 6 Hearts of your
    health are shown, you keep on collecting as much as you can find


    3- Dashing
    as you jump allows you to move much further than if you were to dash without
    jumping


    4- You cannot take damage while you''re dashing nor attack (dashing
    animation is running)


    5- Each boss token together makes a key, just walk
    over to the locked throne room door to open it if you have every token'
