--- !u!114 &1097353443
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1097353441}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ab97b6e1f9f33c74dbe28807a4d3a797, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogText: {fileID: 1031613828}
  DialogRaw:
  - "I really shouldn\u2019t have left this fight to autopilot, oh well"
  - But you are quite good with that sword, could you be here to claim the crown?
  - "It\u2019s really been a long time since anyone tried,  I even forgot why I\u2019m
    still here"
  - "You have no idea what I\u2019m talking about? Curious. . . . ."
  - "Right, I\u2019m sorry but I don\u2019t want to think about this any longer-
    Here\u2019s my token"
  - Get two more of these from the others to open the throne room
  - 'Now go away and bother someone else with your questions. Bye! '
