  DialogRaw:
  - '! ! ! '
  - "How Curious\u2026 I would ask who you are but that\u2019ll just lead to more
    questions"
  - Why are you not dead? How did you get here? Why are you here?
  - Too many questions- those stress me out
  - Please just stop existing instead, my Bronze Colossus V4.8.9 will help you with
    that.
