  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ab97b6e1f9f33c74dbe28807a4d3a797, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogText: {fileID: 1510232187}
  DialogRaw:
  - So it is you isn't it? The one who was been stirring up trouble in the Tower
  - Or should I say, The One who would so boldly dare to rule this kingdom
  - What makes you think you even have the right? Oh you beat a bunch of old idealistic
    ghosts very impressive
  - Well I'm not going to throw everything away just because you happened to stumble
    your way into here
  - '1000 years of progress will not be wasted on the likes of you, Once I''m alive
    again I will rule all '
  - And you would be nothing but a blurb of failure in the history books
